The team of SETA-certified barbers and hair stylists covers the full range of gents’ grooming. Clients can come in for a precise haircut or a fresh style, have their beard neatly trimmed and shaped, or settle in for a traditional razor shave. The shop is air-conditioned, which keeps it comfortable in the Cape summer, and it is wheelchair accessible. Many customers are long-standing regulars who have come back to the same chair for years, which says a lot about the quality and consistency of the work. It is open on weekdays and on Saturday mornings. Shaheem’s Barber is at 229 Victoria Road, Southfield, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'shaheems-barber-southfield' AND description = 'Shaheem''s Barber is a barbershop on Victoria Road in Southfield, offering haircuts and grooming services.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
